  "architecture_rationale": "Event decoupling through Apache Kafka is critical to process 100k emails/hour. Graph transformations are separated from CPU/GPU-intensive GNN execution to meet strict sub-second SLA requirements, while an asynchronous feedback loop manages model updates without performance degradation.",
